          "title": "Vector Databases and Core Workflow",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What a Vector DB Is",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Stores ==vectors + metadata==, answers **top-k** nearest-neighbour queries",
                "DBs: `pgvector`, Pinecone, Qdrant, Weaviate, Milvus",
                "`FAISS` = a {orange:library}, not a DB"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Ingest and Query",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Chunk",
                    "sub": "200-500 tokens, overlap",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Embed",
                    "sub": "each chunk",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Upsert",
                    "sub": "vector + id + metadata",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Embed query",
                    "sub": "same model",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Top-k",
                    "sub": "chosen metric",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Filter",
                    "sub": "metadata, optional",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Return",
                    "sub": "chunks",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. pgvector and Filters",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "sql",
              "lines": [
                "CREATE EXTENSION vector;",
                "CREATE TABLE docs(id serial, body text,",
                "  emb vector(768));",
                "SELECT body FROM docs",
                "ORDER BY emb <=> $1 LIMIT 5;"
              ],
              "note": "$1 = query embedding"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Operator",
                "Meaning"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`<=>`",
                  "cosine distance"
                ],
                [
                  "`<->`",
                  "L2 distance"
                ],
                [
                  "`<#>`",
                  "negative inner product"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Filter after search",
              "text": "Tenant, date, language filters must run **with** the search. Top-k first, then filter, can return ==fewer than k== results."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Approximate Nearest Neighbour Indexes",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Approximate Nearest Neighbour Indexes",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Flat vs ANN",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Flat== search: query vs **every** vector, O(N·d)",
                "{green:Perfect recall}, fine up to ~100k vectors",
                "==ANN== trades a little recall for big speed",
                "Most true neighbours, not guaranteed all",
                "Measured as ==recall@k==: share of true top-k found"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. HNSW",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Top layer",
                    "sub": "sparse entry",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Greedy hop",
                    "sub": "nearest node",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Drop a layer",
                    "sub": "repeat",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Layer 0",
                    "sub": "top-k",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Layered proximity graph: fast, high recall, ==memory-heavy==",
                "`M`: links per node",
                "`efConstruction`: build quality",
                "`efSearch`: query breadth; higher = better recall, slower"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. IVF and PQ",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==IVF==: k-means splits vectors into `nlist` cells",
                "Search only the `nprobe` nearest cells; tune for recall",
                "==PQ== compresses vectors: less memory, some accuracy lost"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "HNSW",
                "IVF"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Memory",
                  "high",
                  "lower"
                ],
                [
                  "Knob",
                  "`efSearch`",
                  "`nprobe`"
                ],
                [
                  "Training",
                  "none",
                  "k-means first"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistakes",
              "text": "Never skip **recall vs a flat baseline**. Never build IVF before the table holds enough ==representative data== to train clusters."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
